<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
  <title>Skyhook Industries — Design Directions</title>
  <style>
    :root{font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;color:#16191d;background:#ece9e1}
    *{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0}.wrap{width:min(1180px,calc(100% - 3rem));margin:auto;padding:4rem 0 6rem}.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:2rem;align-items:flex-start;border-bottom:1px solid #8c8b84;padding-bottom:2rem;margin-bottom:3rem}.kicker{font:700 .72rem/1 ui-monospace,monospace;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase}.top h1{font-size:clamp(3rem,7vw,6.5rem);line-height:.9;letter-spacing:-.065em;margin:.5rem 0 1rem;max-width:10ch}.top p{max-width:40rem;font-size:1.12rem;line-height:1.6;color:#4f5357}.back{font-weight:700;border-bottom:1px solid}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1rem}.card{min-height:34rem;padding:2rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;border:1px solid #85837c;text-decoration:none;color:inherit;transition:transform .18s ease}.card:hover,.recommended:hover{transform:translateY(-4px)}.card b{font:700 .72rem/1 ui-monospace,monospace;letter-spacing:.12em}.card h2{font-size:2.3rem;line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:.7rem 0}.card p{line-height:1.55;max-width:27rem}.a{background:#e8e3d8}.a .mini{border:1px solid #7f807b;padding:1rem;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:.75rem}.b{background:#06090c;color:#f2f5f5}.b p{color:#aeb8bd}.b .mini{height:10rem;border-radius:50% 50% 0 0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 65%,#183a50 0,#07121a 58%,transparent 59%),linear-gradient(115deg,transparent 47%,#d6e5e9 48%,#d6e5e9 49%,transparent 50%)}.c{background:#cbc7bd}.c .mini{border-left:10px solid #df5d28;padding:1rem;background:#17191a;color:#f1eee8;font:700 .8rem/1.5 ui-monospace,monospace}.recommended{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:3rem;margin-top:2.5rem;padding:2.3rem;background:#05090c;color:#f3f6f6;text-decoration:none;transition:transform .18s ease;border:1px solid #1d2b31}.recommended b{font:700 .7rem/1 ui-monospace,monospace;letter-spacing:.12em}.recommended h2{font-size:clamp(2.5rem,5vw,5rem);line-height:.9;letter-spacing:-.06em;margin:.7rem 0 1rem;max-width:9ch}.recommended p{color:#acb7bb;line-height:1.6;max-width:36rem}.rec-visual{min-height:18rem;border-radius:50% 50% 0 0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 70%,#21485f 0,#08131a 59%,transparent 60%),linear-gradient(116deg,transparent 47%,#d9e6e9 48%,#d9e6e9 48.7%,transparent 49.7%);position:relative}.rec-visual:after{content:"STUDY LENGTH  ~4,000 km";position:absolute;right:1rem;top:2rem;font:700 .62rem/1 ui-monospace,monospace;color:#aabac0;letter-spacing:.1em}.rec{margin-top:1.5rem;border-top:1px solid #8c8b84;padding-top:1.5rem;display:grid;grid-template-columns:12rem 1fr;gap:2rem}.rec strong{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;font-size:.75rem}.rec p{margin:0;max-width:55rem;line-height:1.6}@media(max-width:850px){.grid,.recommended{grid-template-columns:1fr}.card{min-height:26rem}.top{display:block}.back{display:inline-block;margin-top:1rem}.rec{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="wrap">
    <header class="top">
      <div><p class="kicker">Skyhook Industries / Design study 01</p><h1>Three ways to make Skyhook feel like itself.</h1><p>These are not themes applied to the same page. Each direction changes the prose, hierarchy, visual explanation and emotional register of the project.</p></div>
      <a class="back" href="/">Current site ↗</a>
    </header>
    <section class="grid">
      <a class="card a" href="/concepts/a/">
        <div><b>A / ADVANCED AEROSPACE PROGRAM</b><h2>Technical authority first.</h2><p>NASA contractor report, flight-test program and advanced-concepts office. Calm, specific, diagram-heavy and unusually legible.</p></div>
        <div class="mini">SYSTEM / MXT-4000<br>MODE / MOMENTUM EXCHANGE<br>STATUS / CONCEPT DEVELOPMENT<br>REFERENCE / NOT TO SCALE</div>
      </a>
      <a class="card b" href="/concepts/b/">
        <div><b>B / ORBITAL MEGASTRUCTURE</b><h2>Make the scale impossible to ignore.</h2><p>The machine comes first. Earth, motion and four thousand kilometres of structure dominate the page; the writing becomes physical and cinematic.</p></div>
        <div class="mini" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      </a>
      <a class="card c" href="/concepts/c/">
        <div><b>C / INDUSTRIAL MACHINE</b><h2>Infrastructure, load paths, hardware.</h2><p>Treat the tether less like a space dream and more like a bridge, crane and launch system combined. Hard edges, material logic, maintenance.</p></div>
        <div class="mini">LOAD PATH A // ACTIVE<br>LOAD PATH B // REDUNDANT<br>SECTION 12 // ISOLATABLE<br>CAPTURE END // SERVICEABLE</div>
      </a>
    </section>
    <a class="recommended" href="/concepts/recommended/"><div><b>RECOMMENDED / B + A</b><h2>Scale first. Engineering underneath.</h2><p>The strongest version I can make from this exploration: the megastructure dominates the opening, then the site resolves into aerospace-study figures, explicit assumptions and harder engineering.</p></div><div class="rec-visual" aria-hidden="true"></div></a>
    <section class="rec"><strong>Working thesis</strong><p><b>About 60% B + 40% A, with selected C.</b> Skyhook should be visually unforgettable because of its scale, but the deeper someone scrolls, the more it should resolve into disciplined aerospace engineering rather than science-fiction spectacle.</p></section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
